 },
 "summary": "Two bipolar operational amplifiers in one 8-pin package, internally compensated so each is stable at a gain of one. Typical input noise is 5 nV/√Hz at 1 kHz, unity-gain bandwidth 12 MHz, slew rate 5 V/µs and open-loop gain 100 V/mV, and the outputs are protected against short circuits. The NE grades are rated for 0 °C to 70 °C and the SA grades for -40 °C to 85 °C. Supplies run from ±5 V to ±15 V.",
