   "description": "A single noninverting stage on amplifier 1. The signal enters the noninverting input through RIN; RF from the output and RG to ground set the gain at the inverting input. Each supply pin has a low-ESR ceramic capacitor to ground; the one on VCC– is fitted only for a split supply, and on a single supply VCC– goes to ground. Amplifier 2 is left unused.",
